### Mission Types

| Type | Effect |
|------|--------|
| `attack` | Battle, loot up to 50% defender resources, return |
| `transport` | Deliver resources, return empty |
| `deploy` | Station fleet permanently (no return) |
| `espionage` | Gather intel, return |
| `harvest` | Collect debris field, return |
